Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: mspaint: Scale the tool box, palette and status bar to the DPI.
 The tool buttons, colour boxes, tool settings box, status bar parts,
 minimum window size and resize handles had fixed pixel sizes. Scale
 them to the screen DPI. The tool box gets icons drawn for higher DPIs
 as vector shapes by tools/render_paint_icons.py into CDEX_ARTWORK_DIR;
 their resource identifiers are IDB_TOOLBARICONS_DPI(dpi) and the strip
 of the highest DPI up to the screen DPI is used. The 16 pixel font
 toolbar icons are enlarged by a whole factor with pixel replication.
